## 2. Model Selection Strategy

### Decision Matrix

| Task Type | Model | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| Code autocomplete, simple lookups | **Haiku 4.5** | Fast, cheap, sufficient |
| Feature development, bug fixing, reviews | **Sonnet 4.6** | Best quality/cost balance |
| Architecture decisions, complex debugging | **Opus 4.6** | Deep reasoning needed |
| Batch jobs, async processing, reports | **Sonnet Batch** | 50% discount, no real-time needed |
| Overnight large-scale analysis | **Opus Batch** | Maximum reasoning at 50% off |

### Stack-Specific Model Guidance

**Adobe Commerce / Magento**
- Haiku → simple attribute mapping, CSV data transforms
- Sonnet → module development, plugin code, GraphQL queries, EAV schema work
- Opus → complex multi-module architecture, performance root-cause analysis, upgrade planning (2.x → 2.4.7+)

**MERN Stack**
- Haiku → boilerplate generation, simple REST endpoint scaffolding
- Sonnet → React component development, Express middleware, MongoDB aggregation pipelines
- Opus → system design, complex state management architecture, security audits

**Shopify**
- Haiku → metafield lookups, simple Liquid snippet fixes, bulk data tasks
- Sonnet → theme development, Remix app builds, GraphQL Admin API queries, Flow automation
- Opus → custom app architecture, complex storefront logic, multi-store strategy

