### 10.1 Model Selection — 30-Second Guide

```
Simple / repetitive task?          → Haiku 4.5
Standard dev task?                 → Sonnet 4.6
Complex architecture / debugging?  → Opus 4.6
No real-time needed?               → Any model via Batch API (50% off)
```

### 10.2 Token Budget by Task

```
Classification / lookup            50–100 tokens
Single function / snippet          300–500 tokens  
Full component / class             600–900 tokens
Feature with multiple files        1000–1500 tokens
Architecture review / analysis     1500–2500 tokens
```

### 10.3 Prompt Structure — Copy Paste Template

```xml
<system_context>[Your cached stack-specific system prompt]</system_context>
<task>[Single specific task]</task>
<context>[Project background — cache if stable]</context>
<constraints>
  - Max tokens: [N]
  - Output format: [JSON/PHP/JSX/Liquid/YAML]
  - Return only: [specific files/objects]
  - Do not: [add boilerplate / explain / regenerate unchanged code]
</constraints>
<examples>[2–5 input→output pairs]</examples>
<data>[Dynamic runtime data: code, errors, logs]</data>
```

### 10.4 Claude Code Quick Commands

```
/cost      → Check session token cost
/compact   → Compress context (use at 75% full)
/clear     → Fresh context for new task
/model     → Switch model mid-session
/review    → Code review current files
# note     → Add session note without triggering Claude
```

